    "This local installed-image proof uses synthetic Google, Microsoft and DAV resources at a fixed owned loopback server. It does not exercise an external provider, external DNS or live TLS.",
    "The restricted preload preserves logical native response URLs while routing to owned HTTP loopback. Candidate persistence pause observes actual installed SQL completion and changes neither writes nor authority decisions. The CLI, shared runtime/providers, credential ports, PostgreSQL ledger and physical container SIGKILL are real installed code.",
